 "about": "ONE WAY, carried over, with a real player joined (forge run --joined): eight round-25 zombies set apart in front of the player, one second-class ticket each; at the bell six are carried and two stay. Frames of the joined client before the tickets, while six are carried and after they are put back; the player's collision hull and a bullet trace through a carried zombie's place and through one that stayed. Stand-in weapon iw7_fhr_zm; stock spawning off; zombies ignore the player.",
 "steps": [
